{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick start"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This page runs Kirana inside the repository it is built in, which needs nothing\nbut a checkout. To add it to your own project instead, run "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana init","source":"npx kirana init"}},{"type":"text","value":" there\n— it shows the setup as a diff before writing it ("},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/start/installation#let-kirana-init-do-it","children":[{"type":"text","value":"installation"}]},{"type":"text","value":")\n— or follow the guide for your framework in\n"},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/frameworks/overview","children":[{"type":"text","value":"supported frameworks"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"component","name":"callout","tagName":"md-callout","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You need "},{"type":"link","href":"https://bun.com","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bun"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 1.4 or newer and Node.js 22.18 or newer. The\ncompiler is written in Rust and compiled to a native addon; building it needs a\nRust toolchain through "},{"type":"link","href":"https://rustup.rs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"rustup"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"properties":{"kind":"important","title":"Before you start"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"1-get-the-repository-running","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Get the repository running"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"git clone https://github.com/kirana-style/kirana.git && cd kirana\nbun install\nbun run build","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">git</span> clone https://github.com/kirana-style/kirana.git &amp;&amp; <span class=\"th-token th-command\">cd</span> kirana\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> install\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> run build","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> run build","source":"bun run build"}},{"type":"text","value":" compiles the native engine first, then this documentation site. When it\nfinishes, the compiler is ready to use."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"2-look-at-a-component","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Look at a component"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every component in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"packages/ui","source":"packages/ui"}},{"type":"text","value":" is written with Kirana. Open one — say\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"packages/ui/src/components/badge.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">tsx</span>","source":"packages/ui/src/components/badge.tsx"}},{"type":"text","value":" — and you will find style handles at the\ntop of the file and an "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" prop on the elements below."}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import { css } from \"@kirana-style/core\"\n\nconst styles = {\n  root: css({\n    display: \"inline-flex\",\n    borderRadius: \"9999px\",\n    paddingInline: \"0.5rem\",\n    fontSize: \"0.75rem\",\n  }),\n}\n\nexport function Badge(props: React.ComponentProps<\"span\">) {\n  return <span {...props} sx={styles.root} />\n}","lang":"tsx","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> { css } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/core&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">const</span> styles = {\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">root</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-function\">css</span>({\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">display</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;inline-flex&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">borderRadius</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;9999px&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">paddingInline</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;0.5rem&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">fontSize</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;0.75rem&quot;</span>,\n  }),\n}\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"th-token th-function\">Badge</span>(<span class=\"th-token th-property\">props</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-type\">React</span>.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">ComponentProps</span>&lt;<span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;span&quot;</span>&gt;) {\n  <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">return</span> &lt;<span class=\"th-token th-tag\">span</span> {...props} <span class=\"th-token th-attr\">sx</span>={styles.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">root</span>} /&gt;\n}","file":"a-component.tsx","title":"a-component.tsx"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"3-start-the-site-and-change-something","children":[{"type":"text","value":"3. Start the site and change something"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"bun dev","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> dev","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This documentation is on <http://localhost:3000>. Change a value in any "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">css</span>({ … })","source":"css({ … })"}},{"type":"text","value":" call and the\npage updates without a reload: the compiler rebuilds the stylesheet and sends it\nthrough Vite's hot update channel."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"4-see-what-it-compiled-to","children":[{"type":"text","value":"4. See what it compiled to"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ask the compiler what it produced, and why a value won:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"# every diagnostic in a directory\nnode packages/kirana/npm/compiler/bin/kirana.ts check packages/ui/src\n\n# which declaration wins for a property, and why\nnode packages/kirana/npm/compiler/bin/kirana.ts trace packages/ui/src/components/badge.tsx:12 color","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-comment\"># every diagnostic in a directory</span>\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">node</span> packages/kirana/npm/compiler/bin/kirana.ts check packages/ui/src\n\n<span class=\"th-token th-comment\"># which declaration wins for a property, and why</span>\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">node</span> packages/kirana/npm/compiler/bin/kirana.ts trace packages/ui/src/components/badge.tsx:12 color","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"trace","source":"trace"}},{"type":"text","value":" prints one line per candidate declaration, marks the winner, and names\nthe step of the "},{"type":"link","href":"/docs/styling/precedence","children":[{"type":"text","value":"precedence ladder"}]},{"type":"text","value":" that decided it."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"where-to-go-next","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Where to go next"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/start/installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — adding Kirana to an app of your own."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/start/first-component","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your first component"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — a button, with the CSS it\ncompiles to."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"/docs/start/mental-model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Mental model"}]},{"type":"text","value":" — the four ideas that make the rest\npredictable."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"quick-start","text":"Quick start","level":1},{"id":"1-get-the-repository-running","text":"1. Get the repository running","level":2},{"id":"2-look-at-a-component","text":"2. Look at a component","level":2},{"id":"3-start-the-site-and-change-something","text":"3. Start the site and change something","level":2},{"id":"4-see-what-it-compiled-to","text":"4. See what it compiled to","level":2},{"id":"where-to-go-next","text":"Where to go next","level":2}]}
